{
  "page": 311,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2327,
      "text": "Lalu apakah engkau telah melihat orang yang mengingkari ayat-ayat Kami dan dia mengatakan, \"Pasti aku akan diberi harta dan anak.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2328,
      "text": "Adakah dia melihat yang gaib atau dia telah membuat perjanjian di sisi Tuhan Yang Maha Pengasih?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2329,
      "text": "Sama sekali tidak! Kami akan menulis apa yang dia katakan, dan Kami akan memperpanjang azab untuknya secara sempurna,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2330,
      "text": "dan Kami akan mewarisi apa yang dia katakan itu,507) dan dia akan datang kepada Kami seorang diri.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2331,
      "text": "Dan mereka telah memilih tuhan-tuhan selain Allah, agar tuhan-tuhan itu menjadi pelindung bagi mereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2332,
      "text": "Sama sekali tidak! Kelak mereka (sesembahan) itu akan mengingkari penyembahan mereka terhadapnya, dan akan menjadi musuh bagi mereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2333,
      "text": "Tidakkah engkau melihat, bahwa sesungguhnya Kami telah mengutus setan-setan itu kepada orang-orang kafir untuk mendorong mereka (berbuat maksiat) dengan sungguh-sungguh?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2334,
      "text": "Maka janganlah engkau (Muhammad) tergesa-gesa (memintakan azab) terhadap mereka, karena Kami menghitung dengan hitungan teliti (datangnya hari siksaan) untuk mereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2335,
      "text": "(Ingatlah) pada hari (ketika) Kami mengumpulkan orang-orang yang bertakwa kepada (Allah) Yang Maha Pengasih, bagaikan kafilah yang terhormat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2336,
      "text": "dan Kami akan menggiring orang yang durhaka ke neraka Jahanam dalam keadaan dahaga.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2337,
      "text": "Mereka tidak berhak mendapat syafaat (pertolongan), kecuali orang yang telah mengadakan perjanjian di sisi (Allah) Yang Maha Pengasih.508)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2338,
      "text": "Dan mereka berkata, \"(Allah) Yang Maha Pengasih mempunyai anak.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2339,
      "text": "Sungguh, kamu telah membawa sesuatu yang sangat mungkar,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 89,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2340,
      "text": "hampir saja langit pecah, dan bumi terbelah, dan gunung-gunung runtuh, (karena ucapan itu),’",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 90,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2341,
      "text": "karena mereka menganggap (Allah) Yang Maha Pengasih mempunyai anak.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 91,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2342,
      "text": "Dan tidak mungkin bagi (Allah) Yang Maha Pengasih mempunyai anak.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2343,
      "text": "Tidak ada seorang pun di langit dan di bumi, melainkan akan datang kepada (Allah) Yang Maha Pengasih sebagai seorang hamba.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 93,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2344,
      "text": "Dia (Allah) benar-benar telah menentukan jumlah mereka dan menghitung mereka dengan hitungan yang teliti.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 94,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2345,
      "text": "Dan setiap orang dari mereka akan datang kepada Allah sendiri-sendiri pada hari Kiamat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 95,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
